# Copy to .env (which is gitignored). Compose substitutes these at `up`.

# Tailscale auth key for the container's own tailscaled. Reusable, non-ephemeral.
# Leave blank to run in host-socket mode (mount the host's tailscaled) or to
# paste the key into the /setup page instead. See README.md.
TS_AUTHKEY=

# Optional: hostname the node joins as (default: tawny).
# TS_HOSTNAME=tawny
